      <p><seg source="#source-244-279">日ハ光レリ、鏡ノ中ニ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-279-314">光ノミ照リカガヤケリ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-314-332">ソハアマリニ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-332-347"><rb>眩</rb><rt>マブ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-347-357">シ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-357-392">日ハ光レリ、鏡ノ中ニ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-392-430">冷ヤカニ照リカガヤケリ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-430-459">ソハアマリニ遠シ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-459-498">遠シ、遠シ、遠シ、遠シ……</seg></p>
    </body>
